    "sections": {
        "description": "The Advertising Services theme features a clean and organized layout suitable for presenting promotional content, campaigns, announcements, and business information in a structured format. It includes responsive design support, customizable homepage sections, banner areas, service listings, testimonial sections, and contact information integration. The theme provides options for navigation menus, widget-ready areas, social media links, and basic customization settings for colors, typography, and layout adjustments. It is compatible with commonly used plugins and is designed to maintain consistent performance across desktop and mobile devices. The homepage structure supports clear content arrangement for showcasing projects, marketing updates, portfolio items, and informational sections. Additional features include blog integration, image display options, footer customization, and flexible content blocks that help maintain an organized and easy-to-navigate website layout."
    },
